        "username": "Edwin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-02T19:32:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have a friend who has an unusual condition where occasionally he will move about drunkenly (despite having nothing to drink!) &nbsp;We found a solution, however. &nbsp;If he actually does drink, the symptom goes away. &nbsp;So, there's one case where drinking was actually helpful.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There's an \"in Soviet Russia\"-type joke in there somewhere, but I can't quite pinpoint it…</p>",
