      {
        "id": 97305,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-08T05:23:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wish it to be known that whenever I see the title of this thread, a shrill voice in my head goes \"Drinks for sale!\" &nbsp;It's getting quite irritating.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Espcially as the quote I'm getting it from is \"Sweets for sale!\", and has nothing to do with drinks at all.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Slightly more on topic, in general I've found that the temperature of water has a much greater effect on its flavor than it's source. &nbsp;</p>",
