        "created_at": "2014-04-08T14:56:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jagarciao\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/48/2010_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jagarciao:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ha. Just checking to make sure that EvanDan55 made it through his Rite of Passage with nothing more (and absolutely no less) than a splitting headache and a decidedly uncooperative stomach the next day.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hate to disappoint, but no–I did not have to suffer a hangover. I am yet to experience one, and plan on keeping that record. The secret is lots of water and bread.</p>\n<p>It was a lot of fun.</p>",
